{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-hertfordshire-county-council-january-2024","content_id":"ceb1c36f-5e88-46cd-a5e8-f7ba06d3e4fa","description":"An improvement notice issued to Hertfordshire County Council following an Ofsted inspection in July 2023.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"65d5df472ab2b30011759614","filename":"Improvement_notice_issued_to_Hertfordshire_County_Council.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":129493,"filename":"Improvement_notice_issued_to_Hertfordshire_County_Council.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9332526","isbn":"","number_of_pages":5,"title":"Improvement notice issued to Hertfordshire County Council","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/65d5df472ab2b30011759614/Improvement_notice_issued_to_Hertfordshire_County_Council.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This improvement notice was lifted on 15 April 2026 following a review of Hertfordshire County Council’s <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> services.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Improvement notice issued to Hertfordshire County Council following an Ofsted and Care Quality Commission <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/919\">area <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> inspection</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The report judged that there were widespread and systemic failings, including 2 areas for priority action and 5 areas for improvement.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"This improvement notice was lifted on 15 April 2026.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-09T15:19:25Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2024-01-15T00:00